hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"518","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ka khadim us ke khane mein use kifayat kare: Us ki garmi aur dhuan, to use bithae aur apne sath khilaye. Phir agar woh inkar kare to ek luqma le aur use [salan mein] tar karke, phir use khilaye.' Aur kabhi farmaya: 'Ya use tar kare'; aur 'use' ka lafz zikr nahin farmaya."
"519","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ghulam ke liye us ka khana aur us ka libas hai; use kaam mein se sirf utna liya jae jitna woh taqat rakhe.'"
"520","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas deenar hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Use apne par kharch karo.' Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas aur hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Use apne bete par kharch karo.' Us ne kaha: Mere paas aur hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Use apni biwi par kharch karo.' Us ne kaha: Mere paas aur hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Use apne khadim par kharch karo.' Us ne kaha: Mere paas aur hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum zyada jante ho.' Sa'id kehte hain: Phir Abu Hurairah jab is hadees ko bayan farmate to kehte: Tumhara beta kehta hai: Mujh par kharch karo, mujhe kis ke supurd karte ho. Tumhari biwi kehti hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe talaq do. Tumhara khadim kehta hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe bech do."
"521","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya main tumhen behtareen gawahon ke bare mein na bataon? Woh jo apni gawahi mange jane se pehle le aae, ya apni gawahi mange jane se pehle bataye.'"
